{"id":"184cdde824ccf8f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-borel-function.md","title":"Borel Function","display":"df-borel-function — Borel Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-borel-function","aliases":["58-df-borel-function","Borel Function"],"display":"df-borel-function — Borel Function","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-borel-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-borel-function</span><span>Borel Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-borel-function — Borel Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbddaeec1a020d3b\" href=\"?note=bbddaeec1a020d3b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md\">../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_X,\\mathcal B_Y\\in V\">\\(f,X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_X,\\mathcal B_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\\)</span> (Borel-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbddaeec1a020d3b\" href=\"?note=bbddaeec1a020d3b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md\">../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (Borel-function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source and target topologies are explicit, matching the seven-argument upstream Borel-map predicate.</li>\n<li>Borel function: preimage of Borel set is Borel; most functions in analysis</li>\n<li>Standard Borel: Polish space + its Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra</li>\n<li>Composition preserves Borel maps whenever the intermediate Borel structure is the same.</li>\n<li>Lusin theorem: Borel function on Polish space is measurable + more</li>\n<li>Borel isomorphism: bijection between standard Borel spaces (not continuous)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kechris, Classical Descriptive Set Theory</li>\n<li>Dudley, Real Analysis and Probability</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbddaeec1a020d3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbddaeec1a020d3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S$ (Borel-map predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-borel-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_X,\\mathcal B_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelFunction}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"e052306286085efd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-borel-function.md|58-df-borel-function]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["bbddaeec1a020d3b"]}